<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>(Tourist rates will differ from those quoted)</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3620/25  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.6870/80  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.8948/55  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4760/70  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     34.82/83   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.6975/85  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1667.3/8.3 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     122.98/05  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.4070/20  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.7661/76  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.4376/23  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>		     1.4233/43  Singapore Dollars</p>
<p>		     0.7720/25  Australian Dollars</p>
<p>		     7.7422/32  Hong Kong Dollars</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.6109/19</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$350.50/351.00</p>
